/-- **[LocAn] Thm C (profinite) in genus `0`, geometric genus form**: as
`placeOfF_eq_of_ratSectionGk_conj_genus_zero_constExt`, with the hypothesis `g(X_{k̄}) = 0`
(the genus over `k̄`, as in the genus `≥ 1` case `LocAn/ThmC.lean`) in place of
`genus K (F (constExt K D)) = 0` (`genus_constExt_eq_zero`). -/
theorem placeOfF_eq_of_ratSectionGk_conj_genus_zero_constExt' (hkf : IsKummerFaithfulGm K)
    (hHL : D.HL = D.H) {x y : RatPoint D} (hx : t ∈ x.A) (hy : t ∈ y.A) {δ : Pi D}
    (hδ : δ ∈ (piToGk D).ker)
    (h : ∀ g, ratSectionGk y hHL hy g = δ * ratSectionGk x hHL hx g * δ⁻¹)
    (hg : genus (kbar k Ω) (F (baseChange D)) = 0) {P Q : Place K (F (constExt K D))}
    (hPQ : P ≠ Q) (hP : P.deg = 1) (hQ : Q.deg = 1) (hPc : tF (constExt K D) ∉ P.1)
    (hQc : tF (constExt K D) ∉ Q.1) :
    placeOfF x = placeOfF y :=
  placeOfF_eq_of_ratSectionGk_conj_genus_zero_constExt hkf hHL hx hy hδ h
    (genus_constExt_eq_zero hg hP) hPQ hP hQ hPc hQc

